{"id": 4043, "title": "Different Answers", "level": "Intermediate", "hsk_tags": ["HSK4"], "slug": "different-answers", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/4043_different-answers.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["一个年轻人来到一个陌生的地方碰到一位老人，年轻人问：\"这里怎么样？”老人反问：\"你的家乡怎么样？”年轻人说：\"糟糕极了。”老人接着说：\"那你快走，这里和你的家乡一样糟糕。”", "又来了另一个年轻人问同样的问题，老人也同样反问，但是这个年轻人回答说：\"我的家乡很好，我很想念家乡……”老人就说：\"这里也同样好。”", "旁观者觉得很奇怪，问老人前后回答不一样的原因。老人说：\"你心里有什么，就会找到什么！”", "你用欣赏的眼光去看，就会发现许多美丽的风景；然而如果你带着不满的态度去看，你就会觉得世界上的一切都很糟糕。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["一個年輕人來到一個陌生的地方碰到一位老人，年輕人問：\"這裡怎麼樣？”老人反問：\"你的家鄉怎麼樣？”年輕人說：\"糟糕極了。”老人接著說：\"那你快走，這裡和你的家鄉一樣糟糕。”", "又來了另一個年輕人問同樣的問題，老人也同樣反問，但是這個年輕人回答說：\"我的家鄉很好，我很想念家鄉……”老人就說：\"這裡也同樣好。”", "旁觀者覺得很奇怪，問老人前後回答不一樣的原因。老人說：\"你心裡有什麼，就會找到什麼！”", "你用欣賞的眼光去看，就會發現許多美麗的風景；然而如果你帶著不滿的態度去看，你就會覺得世界上的一切都很糟糕。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["yī gè nián qīng rén lái dào yī gè mò shēng de dì fang pèng dào yī wèi lǎo rén， nián qīng rén wèn：\" zhè lǐ zěn me yàng？” lǎo rén fǎn wèn：\" nǐ de jiā xiāng zěn me yàng？” nián qīng rén shuō：\" zāo gāo jí le。” lǎo rén jiē zhe shuō：\" nà nǐ kuài zǒu， zhè lǐ hé nǐ de jiā xiāng yī yàng zāo gāo。”", "yòu lái le lìng yī gè nián qīng rén wèn tóng yàng de wèn tí， lǎo rén yě tóng yàng fǎn wèn， dàn shì zhè gè nián qīng rén huí dá shuō：\" wǒ de jiā xiāng hěn hǎo， wǒ hěn xiǎng niàn jiā xiāng ……” lǎo rén jiù shuō：\" zhè lǐ yě tóng yàng hǎo。”", "páng guān zhě jué de hěn qí guài， wèn lǎo rén qián hòu huí dá bù yī yàng de yuán yīn。 lǎo rén shuō：\" nǐ xīn lǐ yǒu shén me， jiù huì zhǎo dào shén me！”", "nǐ yòng xīn shǎng de yǎn guāng qù kàn， jiù huì fā xiàn xǔ duō měi lì de fēng jǐng； rán ér rú guǒ nǐ dài zhe bù mǎn de tài dù qù kàn， nǐ jiù huì jué de shì jiè shàng de yī qiè dōu hěn zāo gāo。"], "english_paragraphs": ["A young man came to a strange place and met an old man. The young man asked, \"How is it here?\" The old man asked, \"How is your hometown?\" The young man said, \"It's terrible.\" The old man continued, \"Then go away, it's as bad as your hometown.\"", "Another young man came and asked the same question, and the old man asked the same question, but the young man replied: \"My hometown is very good, I miss my hometown very much...\" The old man said: \"It is just as good here.\"", "The bystanders found it strange and asked the old man why he gave different answers before and after. The old man said: \"Whatever you have in your heart, you will find!\"", "If you look with an appreciative eye, you will find many beautiful scenery; however, if you look with a dissatisfied attitude, you will feel that everything in the world is terrible."], "english_full": "A young man came to a strange place and met an old man. The young man asked, \"How is it here?\" The old man asked, \"How is your hometown?\" The young man said, \"It's terrible.\" The old man continued, \"Then go away, it's as bad as your hometown.\"\n\nAnother young man came and asked the same question, and the old man asked the same question, but the young man replied: \"My hometown is very good, I miss my hometown very much...\" The old man said: \"It is just as good here.\"\n\nThe bystanders found it strange and asked the old man why he gave different answers before and after. The old man said: \"Whatever you have in your heart, you will find!\"\n\nIf you look with an appreciative eye, you will find many beautiful scenery; however, if you look with a dissatisfied attitude, you will feel that everything in the world is terrible.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī\" data-defn=\"one / single / a (article)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gè\" data-defn=\"classifier for people or objects in general\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nián qīng rén\" data-defn=\"young people / youngster\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">年轻人</span><span class=\"tr\">年輕人</span><rt>nián qīng rén</rt></ruby><